# Pairs with GateOwnership. A gate leaked by a finished split refuses every later split of the leaf.
MODULE: ForegroundReturnsHoldingGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreground split returns from the hint loop without releasing B's split gate
PERTURBS: ForegroundSkipNested

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "nested"
    /\ fg' = "release"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "nested"
    \* MUTATION: the release is skipped
    /\ fg' = "done"
--- END
